{
 "_doc": "The street soda-water automats «Газированная вода» (docs/soda_machines.md): six machines of the plan's street_machines (tools/city_plan.py STREET_MACHINES; the mesh blender/city/buildings/soda_machine.py, things plain and syrup). A coin, rinse the shared glass or not (a passer-by minds), fill it, drink it in sips, the glass goes back on the washer; now and then the coin sticks and a thump on the side frees it (a tap step with chance, once a day a machine; missed: the coin is gone). The syrup of the day turns over six flavours (every [6, r]); each drunk is a stamp of soda_syrups. They work May to October (months) and stand broken on 12% of those days (broken: the die of the building's dressing set \"broken\", the cardboard sign). Words: strings/x_soda.json (city.soda.*). Depends on nothing outside main; when the scenes' \"scene\": true flag (branch interiors-touch-1127) is in, give both procs \"scene\": true so a soda is not counted as a sanatorium procedure.",
